OL,3,GNEWSATributes to boy, 14, who died
OL,4,Aafter he was hit by bus
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a 14-year-old boy who
OL,7,Fdied after he was hit by a bus have
OL,8,Fsaid they cannot describe the
OL,9,F"magnitude of the pain" they are living
OL,10,Fwith.
OL,12,FPolice were called to reports of a
OL,13,Fcollision at The Hard, Portsmouth, at
OL,14,F16:25 BST on Monday.
OL,16,FBeau Croucher, from Portsmouth, died in
OL,17,Fhospital and the driver of the bus, a
OL,18,F39-year-old man from the city, was
OL,19,Farrested on suspicion of causing
OL,20,Fserious injury by dangerous driving. He
OL,21,Fhas been bailed until 17 November.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
