OL,3,GNEWSATributes to boy, 14, who died
OL,4,Aafter he was hit by bus
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a tribute shared through police,
OL,7,FBeau's family said he went out for the
OL,8,Fafternoon but "never came home".
